import time
class RateLimiter:
    def __init__(self, rate: int):
        self.interval = 1.0 / rate
        self.last = 0.0
    def wait(self):
        diff = time.time() - self.last
        if diff < self.interval:
            time.sleep(self.interval - diff)
        self.last = time.time()
```
Bu soddalashtirilgan versiya: chaqiruvlar orasida minimal interval saqlaydi (burst yo'q). Haqiqiy token bucket burst'ga ruxsat beradi.

